{
  "_comment": [
    "Per-skill visibility, consumed by nix-ai -> nix-claude-code -> settings.json.",
    "",
    "on                  full name and description in every session's listing",
    "name-only           name listed, description dropped",
    "user-invocable-only NOT listed; still callable by /name",
    "off                 removed entirely",
    "",
    "user-invocable-only is the manual-invoke tier. It is a settings key, so it",
    "changes no store path and cannot invalidate Claude Code's plugin cache --",
    "unlike injecting disable-model-invocation frontmatter by derivation, which",
    "once left 113 of 115 plugins unloadable.",
    "",
    "KEYS ARE NOT ALL BARE NAMES. A plugin skill keys as 'plugin:skill'; a",
    "personal or project skill keys as its bare name. Generating the map from",
    "bare names silently matches nothing for plugin skills.",
    "",
    "The user-invocable-only set is DERIVED FROM MEASURED USAGE, not judgment:",
    "every skill the model has itself invoked stays listed. A skill the model",
    "has never once reached for cannot lose model-invocation it was not using.",
    "Judgment applied to skill groups once removed 121 skills carrying 164,619",
    "recorded invocations -- do not hand-curate this list.",
    "",
    "skills-registry is exempt and always listed: it is the index of the",
    "demoted tier, and without it every demoted skill is reachable only by",
    "someone who already knows its name."
  ],
  "_regenerate": "keys come from the skill_listing 'names' array of a fresh session transcript; keep-list from: grep -rhoE '\"name\":\"Skill\",\"input\":\\{\"skill\":\"[^\"]+\"' ~/.claude/projects --include='*.jsonl' | sed 's/.*\"skill\":\"//;s/\"$//' | sort -u",
